{"tmdb":453,"tagline":"He saw the world in a way no one could have imagined.","synopsis":"From the heights of notoriety to the depths of depravity, John Forbes Nash Jr. experiences it all. As a brilliant but socially awkward mathematician, he made a groundbreaking discovery early in his career and stands on the brink of international acclaim. But as the handsome and arrogant Nash accepts secret work in cryptography, he becomes entangled in a mysterious conspiracy. His life takes a nightmarish turn and he soon finds himself on a painful and harrowing journey of self-discovery.","directors":[{"name":"Ron Howard","id":6159}],"cast":[{"actor":"Russell Crowe","role":"John Nash","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3IBZF0qCZMZ7zJYlgrH0sQzNZV.jpg","tmdb":934},{"actor":"Jennifer Connelly","role":"Alicia Nash","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bpILtSl6z5xc6YOAiPnDBlXDYMJ.jpg","tmdb":6161},{"actor":"Ed Harris","role":"William Parcher","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kUbUA70WPiosPT4kBJMWtGk0ASd.jpg","tmdb":228},{"actor":"Paul Bettany","role":"Charles Herman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/awlH20l93cgHOIDPNP6FCnGuIJy.jpg","tmdb":6162},{"actor":"Christopher Plummer","role":"Dr. Rosen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u0YBwss0ebEUp8sjRtQKnK2wZdR.jpg","tmdb":290},{"actor":"Adam Goldberg","role":"Richard Sol","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/itmV0tx1LptECxqFGfyPeVl6lM4.jpg","tmdb":6163},{"actor":"Josh Lucas","role":"Martin Hansen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ueR4CH32f22DGjFxuhnW1o3YKB3.jpg","tmdb":6164},{"actor":"Anthony Rapp","role":"Bender","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9Pj11mrX2MsWsOiHRjVDxYS93K5.jpg","tmdb":6165},{"actor":"Jason Gray-Stanford","role":"Ainsley Neilson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6kHaZ4dTuOdi65QsQPCw5lP1fpM.jpg","tmdb":6166},{"actor":"Judd Hirsch","role":"Helinger","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7rJ0TZfMoPLTcO203tHhE6tcPKP.jpg","tmdb":6167},{"actor":"Austin Pendleton","r